== Effects ==
* Spawns an attack locust [[familiar]] identical to the default ones spawned by {{i|Abyss}}. It will fly forward while Isaac is shooting and deals contact damage {{dlc|nr+}} equal to Isaac's [[damage]].
** {{dlc|r+}} The locust is treated as a Quality 3 locust and deals 1.5x Isaac's damage.

== Synergies ==
* {{t|Apollyon's Best Friend}} / {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{I|Mom's Box}}: Each effect/trinket copy stacks, granting an extra locust per stack.
* {{i|BFFS!}} / {{i|Hive Mind}}: Increases the locust's damage by 25%.

== Trivia ==
* Unlike many other effects which grant a familiar lasting multiple rooms, Apollyon's Best Friend is unaffected by the duplication bug from {{i|Glowing Hourglass}}.

